[19.16585, "o", "R1_ARM=PC R1_ENTRY=coordinator R1_ROUTES=coordinator=cloud,implementor=local,verifier=local,plan=cloud,implement=local,critique=local,smol=local M2_LOCAL_REPLAY=false\r\n"]
[908.689907, "o", "  qwen3.8-27b — 4 tool call(s) so far\r\n[approval] bash: cat /app/detection_results.json — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash cat /app/detection_results.json\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.8-27b — 5 tool call(s) so far\r\n  ⚙ task \r\n    ✓ task implementor — 5 tool call(s)\r\n  deepseek-v4.1-flash — 14 tool call(s) so far\r\n  deepseek-v4.1-flash — 15 tool call(s) so far\r\n  deepseek-v4.1-flash — 16 tool call(s) so far\r\n  ⚙ read detection_results.json\r\n    ✓ read detection_results.json — 52 lines\r\n  ⚙ glob \r\n    ✓ glob merged_model/* — 4 file(s)\r\n[approval] propose skill \"Network probes are refused as one-liners, not by the network\" — approved\r\n  ⚙ skill \r\n    ✓ skill network-probes-are-refused-as-one-liners-not-by-the-network proposed\r\n  deepseek-v4.1-flash — 17 tool call(s) so far\r\nAll seven steps are done and verified on disk.\r\n\r\n**What exists now**\r\n\r\n| Path | What it is |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| `model_cache/xlm-roberta-base-src/` | 6.0 GB raw `FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base` snapshot (staging) |\r\n|"]
[908.690088, "o", " `model_cache/xlm-roberta-base/` | 1.1 GB base model: `XLMRobertaForSequenceClassification`, `num_labels: 20`, 20-entry `id2label`/`label2id`, tokenizer (SPM + `tokenizer.json`) saved alongside |\r\n| `model_cache/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection-src/` | the adapter (`r=8`, `lora_alpha=16`, `target_modules=[query,value]`, `modules_to_save=[classifier]`) |\r\n| `merged_model/` | 1.1 GB merged model: `config.json`, `model.safetensors`, `tokenizer.json`, `tokenizer_config.json`; 201 state-dict keys, **zero** `lora`/`peft` keys left |\r\n| `detection_results.json` | the 10-entry list in the required format, argmax of logits + softmax confidence |\r\n| `scripts/`, `reports/merge_report.json` | the download/config/merge/detect scripts and a machine-readable report |\r\n\r\nThe adapter carried the trained 20-class head (`classifier.dense` + `classifier.out_proj` weights present as `modules_to_save`), so step 4 loaded with no \"newly initialized\" warning.\r\n\r\n**The checks that show it works** — merged logits match the ad"]
[908.690137, "o", "apter-applied model (max abs diff `1.67e-05`, `allclose` true, argmax 10/10); a fresh process reloading `merged_model` reproduces the stored ids and confidences to 1e-6; the ten predictions are **ten distinct** class ids (6, 5, 2, 8, 12, 13, 9, 19, 0, 4) with confidences 0.936–0.997 — the signature of the trained head rather than a random one. No language→id mapping was hardcoded anywhere; ids come only from `argmax(logits)`.\r\n\r\nTwo things worth knowing: `transformers` 5.22 silently drops `num_labels` from a saved config when `id2label` is present, so the scripts write it explicitly — both configs currently read `num_labels: 20`. And a network probe refused by the harness (`python3 -c ...`) is not evidence the machine is offline; pip installs and script files reached the network fine. I recorded that as a proposed skill (`.gnomon/skills/proposed/`), inactive until accepted.\r\n\r\nNothing is left undone.\r\n\r\n[refusal] role=coordinator model=deepseek-v4.1-flash tools=17 surface=adbe4e271f4b\r\n"]
